    "cols3_copy": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 07 2025 20:52:33 GMT+0000",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 07 2025 20:52:33 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols3",
      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "topPadding": "5",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:28:21 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #85458a;\">PEEK</span></span></span></p>\n<p>PEEK customized implants by Stryker are designed with exacting parameters to optimize the bone-to implant interface. Multiple fit options are available to accommodate the needs of both you and your patient.</p>\n<p>PEEK CCI has a longstanding safety profile supported by clinical evidence. The reliable support and expertise of your local Stryker representative combined with the strength and fit of your implant allow you to close and reconstruct with confidence.</p>\n<p>Available in PEEK Priority (no design session) and PEEK Complex (requires design session).<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jul 21 2025 17:28:13 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
